      "statement": "Grant field equivalence compares grantee, grantedBy, dataOwner, registeredShapeTree, hasDataRegistration, hasStorage, scopeOfGrant, and the sets accessMode, creatorAccessMode and hasDataInstance; it ignores id, type, inheritsFromGrant and hasInheritingGrant because those are derived or structural.",
