      "id": "claim_ed92348337824b379d7f17107d3f7b05",
      "statement": "Grant equivalence is evaluated over whole subtrees: source grants form a flat tree via id/inheritsFromGrant, delegated grants form a tree from embedded child objects, and an existing flat tree whose declared child body is missing is dropped rather than treated as childless (fail closed).",
